@startuml
title UC-002 — Suite evaluation and baseline regression decision
note as N
Product Spec UC-002
end note
actor "workflow maintainer/user" as Maintainer
actor harness as Harness
actor "evaluator/reviewer" as Evaluator
rectangle "Behavioral Eval suite" {
  usecase "Choose case suite and baseline" as Choose
  usecase "Run each case independently" as Run
  usecase "Aggregate pass rate, quality,\ninconclusive health, efficiency" as Aggregate
  usecase "Compare with baseline and\napply suite thresholds" as Decide
  usecase "Decide suite pass or fail" as Result
}
Maintainer --> Choose
Choose --> Run
Harness --> Run
Run --> Aggregate
Harness --> Aggregate
Aggregate --> Decide
Evaluator --> Decide
Decide --> Result
note right of Decide
Includes hard_gate_failures,
critical pass rate, quality,
inconclusive health, token and latency regression.
end note
@enduml
